:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Plains Widgets [widget]

<!-- 平原上的入口：罗宾被收容、PC 有异种癖特质、当天还没找过。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-robin-tentacle-plains-link'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').asylum.tentacleOpen>>
    <<investigateicon>><<lanLink ['Search the surrounding plains (0:10)', '搜索附近的平原 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Trail'>><<pass 10>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Trail []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>><<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    A pale strip of cloth hangs from a nearby tendril. Beyond it, you notice a door.
    A familiar voice reaches you from the other side.
    <br><br>
    <span class='red'>Robin.</span> You move closer and call out. The voice falls silent.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一条浅色布料挂在附近的触须上。再往前，你发现一扇门。
    门后传来熟悉的声音。
    <br><br>
    <span class='red'>是罗宾。</span>你走近，喊了一声。门后的声音停了下来。
<</language>>
<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<lanLink ['Open the door into the ward', '推开那扇通往病院的门'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Ward'>>
  <<run maplebirch.get('Robin').asylum.tentacleStart()>><<unset $tentacleAmbush>><<unset $tentacleSteps>>
<</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave the door alone', '离开那扇门'] 'Tentacle Plains'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Ward []

<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'asylum'>>
<<if $suspicion isnot undefined and $asylumstatus isnot undefined>><<asylumeffects>><</if>>
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You step into a small room. Robin sits against the wall in a hospital gown.
    Robin looks up at the sound of your voice.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      Robin takes a moment to answer. "You... you came?" <<nnpc_His 'Robin'>> voice shakes.
      Robin reaches for your hand and holds it tightly.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      "Are you okay?" Robin asks, getting shakily to <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> feet. "We should go."
    <<else>>
      "Please take me with you," Robin whispers. "I don't want to stay here."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    Footsteps sound beyond another door. You tell Robin you can try to leave through the plains,
    then find the door to the forest. Robin glances at the tendrils outside and grips your hand.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你走进一间小房间。罗宾穿着病号服，靠墙坐着。
    听见你叫<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>的名字，<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>抬起头。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      罗宾过了一会才回应。“你……你来了？”<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>的声音在发抖。
      <<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>伸手来握你的手，攥得很紧。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      “你没事吧？”罗宾摇晃着站起身。“我们得走了。”
    <<else>>
      “求你带我一起走。”罗宾小声说。“我不想待在这里了。”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    另一扇门外传来脚步声。你告诉罗宾，你们可以试着从平原离开，再找到通往森林的门。
    <<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>看了看外面的触须，握住你的手。
<</language>>
<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80 and C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<gdom 'Robin'>><</if>>
<<npcincr Robin trauma -2>><<lrtrauma>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><<glove 'Robin'>>
<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Take Robin through the door', '带罗宾穿过那扇门'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Crossing'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave Robin here and go back alone', '把罗宾留在这里，自己回去'] 'Tentacle Plains'>><<npcincr Robin trauma 2>><<grtrauma>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Crossing []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>><<effects>><<tentacleworldintro>>
<<set $tentacleSteps to 0>><<set $tentacleAmbush to false>><<set $phase to 0>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You lead Robin through the door. It closes behind you. Far across the plains,
    another door stands open, with trees beyond it.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      Robin stares at the ground, trembling. You squeeze <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> hand and wait until
      <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> can take a step.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      "Stay close," Robin says, looking from the tendrils to you, trying to stand steady.
    <<else>>
      "You know the way, right?" Robin asks, keeping hold of your hand.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你带罗宾穿过那扇门。门在身后关上。平原远处，还有一扇敞开的门，门后是树木。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      罗宾盯着地面，浑身发抖。你握了握<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>的手，等<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>能迈出一步。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      “别走散了。”罗宾说。<<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>看看触须，又看看你，努力站稳。
    <<else>>
      “你认得路，对吧？”罗宾问，仍然握着你的手。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin lust 3>><<glust 'Robin'>><<npcincr Robin trauma 3>><<grtrauma>>
<<stress 8>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Step out onto the plains', '走进平原'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle March []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>><<effects>>
<<if $tentacleorgasmignore is undefined>><<set $tentacleorgasmignore to 0>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Tendrils reach for you as you walk. The air is sweet. Robin grips your hand more tightly.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你走过时，触须伸向你，空气散发着甜味。罗宾把你的手握得更紧了。
<</language>>
<<drugs 10>><<ggarousal>><<arousal 1200>>
<br><br>
<<switch $phase>>
  <<case 1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You walk north.' '你向北走。'>>
    <br><br>
  <<case 2>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You walk south.' '你向南走。'>>
    <br><br>
  <<case 3>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You walk east.' '你向东走。'>>
    <br><br>
  <<case 4>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You walk west.' '你向西走。'>>
    <br><br>
<</switch>>
<<set $phase to 0>>
<<if random(1, 100) lte 50 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<npcincr Robin trauma 1>><<grtrauma>>
<</if>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot keep walking.' '你再也走不动了。'>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Failed'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif $arousal gte $arousalmax and $eventskip isnot 1 and $tentacleorgasmignore lte 0>>
  <<orgasm>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The tentacles around you are roused by it and strike. They coil around your arms and drag you
      down, taking Robin with you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你周围的触手被激发了，疾射而来。它们缠绕在你的手臂上，把你们两人一起拖向地面。
    <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Combat'>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<if $arousal gte $arousalmax and $tentacleorgasmignore gte 1>>
    <<orgasm>><<set $tentacleorgasmignore -= 1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The tentacles do not catch you off guard.' '触手没有抓到你的破绽。'>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $tentacleAmbush>>
    <<set $tentacleAmbush to false>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The ground tilts without warning. Coils come up out of the silt on both sides at once and
        reach towards the two of you.
        <br><br>
        Robin stumbles and catches your arm before <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> can cry out,
        trying to stay upright.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        地面毫无预兆地倾斜。两侧的淤泥里同时立起触须，朝你们伸来。
        <br><br>
        罗宾还没喊出声就踉跄了一下。<<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>抓住你的手臂，努力站稳。
      <</language>>
    <<npcincr Robin trauma 3>><<grtrauma>><<npcincr Robin lust 2>><<glust 'Robin'>>
    <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
    <br><br>
    <<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Stand your ground', '挡在罗宾前面'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Combat'>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<if $tentnorth is 0 and $tenteast is 0>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The door back into the ward is here. Robin hesitates beside it.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          通往病院的门就在这里。罗宾停在门旁，迟迟没有上前。
        <</language>>
      <br>
      <<asylumicon 'door'>><<lanLink ['Go back through the ward door', '从病院的门回去'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Handover'>><</lanLink>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $tentnorth is $tentportalnorth and $tenteast is $tentportaleast>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A door stands open here. There is a forest behind it. Robin watches it without
          a word.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一扇门在这里敞开着。门后是一片森林。罗宾看着它，什么也没说。
        <</language>>
      <br>
      <<foresticon>><<lanLink ['Run for it', '往门口跑'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Escape'>><</lanLink>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $tentnorth gte 5 or $tentnorth lte -5 or $tenteast gte 5 or $tenteast lte -5>>
      <<lanSwitch 'The plains go on past the horizon. You do not want to get further from the doors.' '平原一直延伸到地平线。你不想离那两扇门太远。'>>
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $tentnorth lt 5>>
      <<tentacleicon 'north'>><<lanLink ['North (0:10)', '向北 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>>
        <<pass 10>><<set $tentnorth += 1>><<set $phase to 1>>
        <<set $tentacleSteps to $tentacleSteps + 1>>
        <<set $tentacleAmbush to ($RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleWave is 0 and $tentacleSteps gte 3) or random(1, 100) lte 40>>
      <</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $tentnorth gt -5>>
      <<tentacleicon 'south'>><<lanLink ['South (0:10)', '向南 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>>
        <<pass 10>><<set $tentnorth -= 1>><<set $phase to 2>>
        <<set $tentacleSteps to $tentacleSteps + 1>>
        <<set $tentacleAmbush to ($RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleWave is 0 and $tentacleSteps gte 3) or random(1, 100) lte 40>>
      <</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $tenteast lt 5>>
      <<tentacleicon 'east'>><<lanLink ['East (0:10)', '向东 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>>
        <<pass 10>><<set $tenteast += 1>><<set $phase to 3>>
        <<set $tentacleSteps to $tentacleSteps + 1>>
        <<set $tentacleAmbush to ($RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleWave is 0 and $tentacleSteps gte 3) or random(1, 100) lte 40>>
      <</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $tenteast gt -5>>
      <<tentacleicon 'west'>><<lanLink ['West (0:10)', '向西 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>>
        <<pass 10>><<set $tenteast -= 1>><<set $phase to 4>>
        <<set $tentacleSteps to $tentacleSteps + 1>>
        <<set $tentacleAmbush to ($RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleWave is 0 and $tentacleSteps gte 3) or random(1, 100) lte 40>>
      <</lanLink>>
      <br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Combat []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>>
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
  <<set $molestationstart to 0>>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
  <<npcClothesType $NPCList[0] 'patient'>>
  <<run statusCheck('Robin')>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
  <<maninit>>
  <<silently>><<npc_submissive>><</silently>>
  <<npcexpose>>
  <<set $fightTargets to []>>
  <<set $breakIgnore to true>>
  <<tentaclestart 8 15>>
  <<set $enemyarousalmax to 800>>
  <<npcincr Robin trauma 2>><<grtrauma>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You put yourself between the coils and Robin. The first one wraps your thigh before you have
      finished moving. Behind you, Robin grabs your arm and holds on with
      the last of <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> strength.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把自己挡在触须和罗宾之间。还没站稳，第一条就缠上了你的大腿。
      身后，罗宾抓住你的手臂，用尽了剩下所有的力气。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<!-- 沿用原版同行遭遇，每回合复位怒气与信任。 -->
<<set $enemyanger to 0>><<set $enemytrust to 100>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<effectstentacles>>
<<tentacles>>
<<statetentacles>>
<<stateman>>
<br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<print either(
      'A coil reaches for Robin. You knock it aside and it takes your wrist instead.',
      'A coil hauls Robin half off the ground. You grab the front of the gown and drag Robin back down.',
      'A coil takes Robin around the ankle. Robin struggles, then grabs hold of you instead.'
    )>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<print either(
      '一根触须朝罗宾伸过去。你把它拨开，它转而在你手腕上收紧。',
      '罗宾被拽得站不稳，你攥住病号服前襟，把罗宾拉了回来。',
      '一根触须缠住罗宾的脚踝。罗宾挣了几下，然后抓住了你的手。'
    )>>
<</language>>
<br>
<<actionsOmni>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Failed'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $tentacles.active lte ($tentacles.max / 2)>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Combat Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Combat'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Close []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>>
<<set $RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleClose += 1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You put an arm around Robin and wait.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      Robin says nothing at first, then clings to you, trembling, and begins to cry quietly.
      You stay beside <<nnpc_him 'Robin'>> until <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> can move again.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      "Can you still walk?" Robin asks, looking you over.
      Robin keeps an arm around you as you stand.
    <<else>>
      "Th-thank you," Robin whispers. "Can we go now?"
      Robin takes your hand again.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你用一条手臂环住罗宾，陪<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>待了一会。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      罗宾一开始没有说话。<<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>抓着你，颤抖着，随后轻轻哭了起来。
      你留在<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>身边，直到<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>能继续走。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      “还能走吗？”罗宾打量着你。
      你站起身时，<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>仍用一条手臂扶着你。
    <<else>>
      “谢、谢谢你。”罗宾小声说。“我们现在能走了吗？”
      <<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>重新握住你的手。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin trauma -2>><<lrtrauma>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove 'Robin'>>
<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Keep moving across the plains', '继续穿过平原'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Combat Finish []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>><<effects>>
<<set $RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleWave += 1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The tentacles loosen their grip and sink into the ground. You pull Robin away from them.
    Robin stumbles, but manages to stay upright.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      Robin keeps looking behind you. "They're coming back," Robin whispers.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      "Come on," Robin says, holding your hand. "Before they come back."
    <<else>>
      "Is it over?" Robin asks, staying close as you lead Robin away.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    触手松开束缚，沉回地面。你把罗宾拉远了些。
    <<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>踉跄了一下，勉强站稳。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      罗宾一直看着你身后。“它们会回来的。”<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>小声说。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      “快走。”罗宾握着你的手。“趁它们还没回来。”
    <<else>>
      “结束了吗？”罗宾问。你带<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>离开，<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>紧跟着你。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove 'Robin'>><<stress 6>><<gstress>><<pain 4>><<gpain>>
<br><br>
<<endcombat>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Failed'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Catch your breath', '喘口气'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Rest'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Rest []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>><<effects>>
<<set $tentacleSteps to 0>><<set $tentacleAmbush to false>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You stop long enough to catch your breath. Robin stays beside you, watching the ground.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      "Please don't let go," Robin whispers. Robin's hands are still shaking.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      Robin checks that you can stand before straightening up. "Ready?" Robin asks.
    <<else>>
      "Can we get home from here?" Robin asks. You point towards the forest door.
      Robin nods and takes your hand.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你停下来喘了口气。罗宾待在你身边，盯着地面。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      “求你别松手。”<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>小声说。<<nnpc_His 'Robin'>>的双手仍在发抖。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      罗宾确认你还能站稳，才直起身。“准备好了吗？”<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>问。
    <<else>>
      “从这里能回家吗？”罗宾问。你指向森林那扇门。
      <<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>点点头，握住你的手。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80 and C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<gdom 'Robin'>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleClose lt $RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleWave>>
  <<loveicon>><<lanLink ['Comfort Robin (0:05)', '安慰罗宾 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle Close'>><<pass 5>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<getinicon>><<lanLink ['Keep moving across the plains', '继续穿过平原'] 'Deadwood Robin Tentacle March'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Escape []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>><<effects>>
<<if $tentacleEntrance is 'asylum'>>
  <<asylumescape>><<badEndTrackingEnd 'Asylum' { reason: 'asylumTentacle' }>>
<</if>>
<<run maplebirch.get('Robin').asylum.rescue()>>
<<endevent>><<tentacleworldend>><<unset $tentacleSteps>><<unset $tentacleAmbush>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<location 'forest'>>
<<set $forest to random(50, 100)>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You lead Robin through the open door. It closes behind you. Trees surround you,
    and the air is clear again.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      Robin keeps hold of your hand. "Please don't leave yet," Robin whispers.
      You wait with Robin before looking for a path.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      "We're out," Robin says, then looks at you. "Are you okay?"
      Robin stays beside you as you start walking.
    <<else>>
      Robin looks back at the closed door. "We can go home now?" Robin asks.
      You nod, and Robin takes your hand.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <span class='blue'>Robin has escaped the asylum.</span> Robin still needs time to recover.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你带罗宾穿过敞开的门。门在身后合拢。周围是树木，空气重新变得清新。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      罗宾仍握着你的手。“求你先别走。”<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>小声说。
      你陪<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>待了一会，才开始寻找小路。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      “我们出来了。”罗宾说着，看向你。“你没事吧？”
      你开始走动时，<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>仍留在你身边。
    <<else>>
      罗宾回头看了看关上的门。“现在能回家了？”<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>问。
      你点点头，<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>握住你的手。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <span class='blue'>罗宾逃出了精神病院。</span><<nnpc_He 'Robin'>>仍需要时间恢复。
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin trauma -12>><<lrtrauma>><<npcincr Robin love 3>><<glove 'Robin'>>
<<stress -20>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Keep walking into the forest', '继续往森林里走'] 'Forest'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Handover []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'asylum'>>
<<if $suspicion isnot undefined and $asylumstatus isnot undefined>><<asylumeffects>><</if>>
<<effects>>
<<run maplebirch.get('Robin').asylum.returnFromTentacles()>><<unset $tentacleSteps>><<unset $tentacleAmbush>>
<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You lead Robin through the ward door. It closes behind you. Footsteps approach before you
    can find another way out.
    <br><br>
    A nurse stops at the end of the corridor. She looks at Robin's gown, then at you, and calls for
    Doctor Harper. Two orderlies arrive with Harper, blocking the corridor.
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      Robin stares at the closed door, trembling. You reach for Robin's hand, but an orderly steps
      between you.
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      Robin steps in front of you. "We're leaving together," Robin says, voice shaking. An orderly
      catches Robin's arm before you can move.
    <<else>>
      Robin clutches your arm. "Please don't leave me," Robin whispers. An orderly pulls Robin
      away while the other takes hold of your arms.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    Harper smiles. "You both need some rest. Let us take care of you." Harper presses a
    cloth against your face. The corridor blurs. You hear Robin call your name as the orderlies
    take you in opposite directions.
    <br><br>
    <span class='red'>Robin is still confined. You have been taken into the asylum as well.</span>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你带着罗宾穿过病院的门。门在身后合拢。还没找到别的出口，走廊里便传来脚步声。
    <br><br>
    一名护士停在走廊尽头，看看罗宾的病号服，又看看你，喊来了哈珀医生。
    两名护工跟在<<him>>身后，把走廊堵住。
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 80>>
      罗宾盯着关上的门，浑身发抖。你伸手去握罗宾的手，一名护工却挤到了你们之间。
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
      罗宾挡在你面前。“我们要一起走。”罗宾的声音在发抖。你还没来得及动，护工就抓住了罗宾的胳膊。
    <<else>>
      罗宾攥紧你的手臂。“求你别丢下我。”罗宾小声说。一名护工把罗宾拉开，另一名则抓住了你的双臂。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    哈珀微笑着。“你们两个都需要休息。让我们照顾你们吧。”<<He>>把一块布按在你的脸上。
    走廊渐渐模糊。护工把你们带向不同的方向，你听见罗宾喊着你的名字。
    <br><br>
    <span class='red'>罗宾仍被收容，你也被关进了精神病院。</span>
  <</language>>
<<npcincr Robin trauma 8>><<grtrauma true>><<trauma 12>><<gtrauma>><<stress 12>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<set _robinAsylumRecord to $badEndStats.last()>>
<<if _robinAsylumRecord?.source is 'Asylum' and !_robinAsylumRecord.trackedEnd>>
  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Asylum Room 2'>><<endevent>><<npc Harper>><<person1>><<tentacleworldend>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Asylum Intro'>>
    <<set $asylum to 1>><<set $harper_appointments.enabled to true>><<unset $schoolPsych>>
    <<endevent>><<tentacleworldend>><<badEndTracking 'Asylum'>><<pass 30>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Robin Tentacle Failed []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'tentworld'>>
<<if $combat is 1>><<endcombat>><</if>>
<<set $RobinExpansion.asylum.tentacleFailures += 1>>
<<run maplebirch.get('Robin').asylum.returnFromTentacles()>>
<<unset $tentacleSteps>><<unset $tentacleAmbush>>
<<npcincr Robin trauma 4>><<grtrauma>><<trauma 8>><<gtrauma>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Your legs give way. Robin catches your hand, but cannot keep you standing.
    You hear Robin calling your name as everything begins to blur.
    <br><br>
    <span class='red'>You cannot get Robin out this time.</span>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你的双腿支撑不住了。罗宾抓住你的手，却没能让你站稳。
    眼前的一切渐渐模糊，你听见<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>喊着你的名字。
    <br><br>
    <span class='red'>这次你没能带罗宾离开。</span>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<passouttentacleworld>>
